WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.541
Snippy sliced the air with his blades.

2
00:00:15.442 --> 00:00:16.882
Snip! Snip!

3
00:00:18.363 --> 00:00:19.663
He moved closer to Roxy.

4
00:00:21.184 --> 00:00:23.325
Roxy shot her eye laser beams at the blades.

5
00:00:23.925 --> 00:00:27.647
Whiz-hoo! The blades exploded into little pieces.

6
00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:29.988
"Gah!" cried Mr.

7
00:00:30.048 --> 00:00:33.330
Snippy. "I don't care if you have eye laser beams.

8
00:00:34.191 --> 00:00:36.493
You'll never stop me, Rocket Girl!"

9
00:00:37.854 --> 00:00:39.876
Mr. Snippy ran to the back of the salon.

10
00:00:41.097 --> 00:00:43.259
A tiny white poodle stood chained to a table.

11
00:00:43.279 --> 00:00:45.601
"Yip, yip!"

12
00:00:45.781 --> 00:00:46.561
The poodle barked.

13
00:00:47.863 --> 00:00:50.485
"Daisy just had a haircut," said Mr.

14
00:00:50.525 --> 00:00:54.789
Snippy. "And now I'll put on her brand-new collar!"

15
00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.192
Mr. Snippy put the collar onto Daisy.

16
00:00:59.336 --> 00:01:02.918
Roxy gasped as the little poodle turned into a snarling monster dog!

17
00:01:02.938 --> 00:01:07.299
"I was right, Snippy!"

18
00:01:07.559 --> 00:01:08.500
Roxy said angrily.

19
00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.861
"Your collars are turning pets into monsters!"

20
00:01:12.882 --> 00:01:14.602
Mr. Snippy had an evil grin.

21
00:01:14.622 --> 00:01:18.524
"My apartment building doesn't allow pets.

22
00:01:19.484 --> 00:01:23.106
So I had to give away my cute little puppy.

23
00:01:24.086 --> 00:01:28.288
Now no one in Metro City will ever have a cute little pet again!"

24
00:01:30.288 --> 00:01:32.190
"Ha-ha-ha!" Mr.

25
00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:35.272
Snippy's laugh filled the salon as the poodle leaped at Roxy.

26
00:01:35.292 --> 00:01:36.754
"YIP, YIP!"

27
00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:37.634
Daisy barked.

28
00:01:37.654 --> 00:01:40.677
"Ahh!" Roxy jumped out of the way.

29
00:01:41.558 --> 00:01:43.319
The little dog was trying to attack her!

30
00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:47.042
Roxy floated in the air above the barking poodle.

31
00:01:47.062 --> 00:01:49.585
"I need a plan," she thought.

32
00:01:50.625 --> 00:01:52.307
Just then she heard a whirring noise.

33
00:01:53.608 --> 00:01:54.949
It was coming from behind a door.

34
00:01:54.969 --> 00:01:56.650
"YIP, YIP!"

35
00:01:57.011 --> 00:01:58.132
Daisy was still barking.

36
00:01:59.164 --> 00:02:01.486
Roxy used her x-ray vision to look through the door.

37
00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:05.510
There was a room with video screens, switches, and blinking lights.

38
00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:10.654
"I'll bet that equipment controls all the collars," thought Roxy.

39
00:02:11.635 --> 00:02:13.316
She made a fist and flew at the door.

40
00:02:14.117 --> 00:02:16.719
Ka-bam! She smashed the door into pieces.

41
00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:24.146
Then—whiz-hoo! She fired her eye laser beams, and the equipment exploded.

42
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:26.007
"No!" cried Mr.

43
00:02:26.047 --> 00:02:31.509
Snippy. "You destroyed Collar Control Central!"

44
00:02:31.529 --> 00:02:35.650
"Yip, yip!"

45
00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:36.670
Daisy barked.

46
00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.171
She licked Roxy's face happily.

47
00:02:39.871 --> 00:02:41.071
She was a normal dog again.

48
00:02:42.131 --> 00:02:43.912
Roxy waited for Daisy's owner to come.

49
00:02:45.792 --> 00:02:46.653
Then she took Mr.

50
00:02:46.693 --> 00:02:47.413
Snippy to jail.

51
00:02:49.373 --> 00:02:50.974
Roxy returned to Metro City Park.

52
00:02:51.714 --> 00:02:53.154
She saw the man with one shoe.

53
00:02:53.895 --> 00:02:54.875
He was walking Buster.

54
00:02:54.895 --> 00:02:58.616
"I'm glad you're a normal dog again, Buster," said the man.

55
00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.781
Roxy soon found her friends.

56
00:03:03.701 --> 00:03:04.762
Max was still sleeping.

57
00:03:04.782 --> 00:03:06.943
"Guess what!"

58
00:03:07.183 --> 00:03:07.824
said Terrell.

59
00:03:09.004 --> 00:03:11.466
"Rocket Girl saved us from monster pets!"

60
00:03:12.566 --> 00:03:13.227
Mara nodded.

61
00:03:13.247 --> 00:03:15.808
"The pets were awful!"

62
00:03:17.049 --> 00:03:18.670
She looked down at Max and hugged him.

63
00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.331
"Not like boring Max!"

64
00:03:22.912 --> 00:03:23.673
Roxy laughed.

65
00:03:23.693 --> 00:03:26.634
"Good dog, Max!"
